        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Another example of a package management tool
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <h3>NuGet</h3>
<p>NuGet packages are zip files with a manifest of metadata, data, and config files.  It is the standard packaging format for the Microsoft .NET platform.  It would typically be used within Azure DevOps which is Microsoft’s cloud CI/CD platform at the deployment stage of the project.  Once a build has been done it would show as a packaged artefact.</p>

